WEBVTT

00:19.830 --> 00:20.910
Let's go.

00:20.910 --> 00:21.700
Okay.

00:22.660 --> 00:23.920
Are you okay?

00:23.920 --> 00:25.960
She didn't take your soul?

00:25.960 --> 00:26.790
Nope.

00:28.670 --> 00:33.300
Everyone here lost their parents in the Lightless Realm.

00:34.130 --> 00:40.850
But I felt like I had lost something more important than that.

00:43.140 --> 00:50.070
When was it that I started to search for it, relying on nothing but a faint memory?

01:03.120 --> 01:08.710
The Dark Metal

01:03.160 --> 01:03.200
The Dark Metal

01:08.710 --> 01:13.130
Night turns to day, and day turns to night. Our wishes have wilted away

01:13.130 --> 01:17.300
Where did the person I want to meet go?

01:17.300 --> 01:21.760
Interlocking these fingers with my beloved

01:21.760 --> 01:25.520
Even though I can't feel them, I continue to live

01:25.560 --> 01:30.150
When the flower's petals

01:30.150 --> 01:34.280
Are plucked off by the wind's playful gale

01:34.280 --> 01:38.740
They are scattered in every direction

01:38.740 --> 01:44.080
Even if you long for it

01:45.080 --> 01:49.790
Don't disappear, just don't

01:49.790 --> 01:53.590
I can even give everything else away if I have to

01:53.590 --> 01:58.430
You were there, and I was there with you

01:58.430 --> 02:02.760
Let me take in these memories

02:02.760 --> 02:09.690
These brief moments are connected, turning it into eternity

02:28.160 --> 02:32.880
Episode 12
What Links Two People

02:33.670 --> 02:36.920
The Argent is 10 km away from the Lightless Realm's center.

02:36.920 --> 02:38.420
Tracking it directly is impossible.

02:38.420 --> 02:41.300
Therefore the location will be based on data alone.

02:43.180 --> 02:48.730
The resonance level is steady,
and all vital signs are normal.

02:48.730 --> 02:51.100
So this is what the MA-Vess—

02:51.100 --> 02:53.360
the LIM—is capable of doing.

02:54.320 --> 02:56.150
Do you copy, Argent?

02:56.150 --> 02:58.320
Yes. This is the Argent.

03:04.990 --> 03:07.290
Confirming current status...

03:08.790 --> 03:11.210
Retrieval of Sable...

03:11.210 --> 03:15.170
Looks like I'm all alone with you again.

03:15.920 --> 03:16.880
Big Brother,

03:17.800 --> 03:20.220
I'm just like you.

03:20.220 --> 03:22.180
I have someone I want to protect.

03:23.430 --> 03:30.230
Sasame, it feels like your warmth and your kindess is still here.

03:30.640 --> 03:36.230
I'll defeat that Corpse, so can you wait for me until then?

03:37.440 --> 03:38.730
Yeah.

03:40.610 --> 03:41.900
It's a promise.

03:41.900 --> 03:43.990
I'll be sure to defeat it.

03:43.990 --> 03:46.700
So until I do, please wait for me.

03:59.260 --> 04:00.380
Akashi-kun...

04:01.170 --> 04:05.140
Akashi-kun's warmth is still with me.

04:06.640 --> 04:09.890
This memory is something I don't ever want to lose.

04:09.890 --> 04:13.270
No matter what happens, I don't want to forget.

04:14.440 --> 04:15.730
Sasame.

04:15.730 --> 04:19.070
Isn't it better for you to be in the car?

04:19.070 --> 04:22.780
'Cause, you know, this is pretty close to the Lightless Realm.

04:22.780 --> 04:24.360
It's probably better not to stay outside too long.

04:26.950 --> 04:28.370
Thank you very much.

04:34.170 --> 04:39.090
After coming here, I have found so many things dear to me.

04:39.630 --> 04:46.390
I think we introduced you to her name
and photo during the briefing session...

04:47.850 --> 04:49.140
Please come in.

04:54.020 --> 04:55.140
That girl...

04:56.980 --> 04:59.070
Nice to meet you all.

04:59.980 --> 05:01.730
Why're you staring so hard?

05:01.730 --> 05:03.490
Are you into girls like her?

05:05.450 --> 05:09.030
I met everyone in Gargouille here.

05:09.740 --> 05:13.830
I felt like I could find out what I lost if I came here.

05:15.370 --> 05:19.170
I was never confident about myself.

05:19.170 --> 05:22.800
And I couldn't accept other people into my life.

05:23.590 --> 05:25.470
But the days here were wonderful.

05:25.470 --> 05:30.510
I felt like a part of my heart was satisfied in some way.

05:32.180 --> 05:38.600
When I was next to Akashi-kun, I always felt something warm within my heart.

05:39.940 --> 05:42.190
And over time, I started feeling

05:43.400 --> 05:46.030
that I wanted to stay by his side.

05:47.110 --> 05:50.950
Akashi-kun, I want to stay by your side.

05:53.200 --> 05:54.160
But...

05:56.000 --> 05:58.330
Admonitions used to be humans.

05:58.750 --> 06:00.750
But they aren't human.

06:00.750 --> 06:02.340
Nothing but their lingering feelings,

06:02.340 --> 06:05.420
regrets, and attachments. It's nothing good.

06:05.420 --> 06:07.340
But that's <i>still</i> human!

06:08.010 --> 06:09.470
Emiru-san...

06:10.550 --> 06:14.810
I also think that feelings are part of a person.

06:14.810 --> 06:17.310
What good does it do to be trapped by the past?

06:17.310 --> 06:22.940
So much easier than being trapped by the past...

06:39.790 --> 06:44.210
Akashi-kun's heart is trapped in a dark past all alone.

06:49.590 --> 06:54.430
The more I stayed by his side,
the more that pain of his flowed into me.

06:55.260 --> 06:56.970
And yet...

07:01.480 --> 07:02.020
Akashi!

07:02.020 --> 07:03.520
Akashi-kun!

07:03.520 --> 07:04.480
Hold on, Sasame!

07:06.730 --> 07:07.990
Sasame!

07:12.070 --> 07:13.200
Sasame!

07:14.660 --> 07:18.040
And yet, I still can't do anything at all.

07:30.130 --> 07:31.590
The Corpse!

07:50.990 --> 07:52.200
What's wrong?

07:52.200 --> 07:54.030
Did you feel something?

07:54.030 --> 07:56.910
This is probably the Corpse's voice.

07:58.120 --> 08:00.960
Akashi-kun is fighting.

08:01.460 --> 08:03.670
Akashi! Did the Corpse appear?

08:04.130 --> 08:06.090
Akashi, answer me!

08:06.090 --> 08:08.550
Any form of communication is ineffective right now.

08:09.300 --> 08:10.380
Akashi...

08:11.050 --> 08:14.300
Keep sending orders to avoid combat and to retreat.

08:15.050 --> 08:17.050
We can only hope for a miracle.

08:17.050 --> 08:18.060
Understood.

08:20.600 --> 08:22.100
Dammit!

08:27.860 --> 08:30.610
You damned Corpse. Where'd you go?

09:12.740 --> 09:14.200
Dammit.

09:14.780 --> 09:17.240
The Corpse is in pain.

09:18.620 --> 09:19.780
How's Akashi?

09:23.410 --> 09:25.250
Has there been any response?

09:25.250 --> 09:27.120
None as of yet.

09:28.080 --> 09:31.550
Let's wait for when the effects
of the Lightless Realm weaken.

09:34.550 --> 09:36.010
Right.

09:36.010 --> 09:40.930
It seems we're in for the long haul this time, so you should head back for now.

09:40.930 --> 09:43.060
Especially Sasame.

09:43.060 --> 09:47.560
The Nectrometal may spread if she stays near the Lightless Realm.

09:47.560 --> 09:49.480
Just like with Emiru.

09:50.360 --> 09:51.520
Yeah.

09:52.360 --> 09:54.740
Iwato and Raika are just fine.

10:01.410 --> 10:03.290
I'm waiting for you!

10:14.630 --> 10:19.260
To defeat the Corpse, I have to be able to move faster.

10:21.140 --> 10:22.390
As I stand now...

10:34.900 --> 10:36.440
Sasame...

10:44.240 --> 10:45.240
Akashi-kun...

10:46.080 --> 10:49.290
What I've always been searching for...

10:50.000 --> 10:52.670
And that precious memory I lost...

10:53.420 --> 10:56.340
It was Akashi-kun who gave it to me.

11:03.890 --> 11:05.640
You'll catch a cold if you're like that.

11:06.890 --> 11:08.520
Thank you.

11:10.020 --> 11:14.610
What I had lost was your warm smile.

11:17.440 --> 11:20.450
But that wasn't all...

11:21.360 --> 11:25.580
There was another thing I had forgotten.

11:25.580 --> 11:28.330
And forgetting that was my sin.

11:37.420 --> 11:38.880
Morning!

11:38.880 --> 11:40.720
Good morning...

11:40.720 --> 11:43.680
Sorry for the hold up on your
turn in the shower, Suzaki-san!

11:52.650 --> 11:55.060
I'm so happy!

11:53.600 --> 11:55.060
We finally get some time to rest.

11:55.060 --> 11:57.320
We've spent two whole nights here.

11:57.320 --> 12:00.070
Did you find out anything about Akashi?

12:00.070 --> 12:05.030
For a brief moment, we were able to
receive his vitals and movement data.

12:05.030 --> 12:09.910
It worries me that his resonance has gone down slightly, although everything else was normal.

12:27.140 --> 12:28.510
Get the hell out of my way!

12:30.310 --> 12:31.810
I don't have time to waste on—

12:36.860 --> 12:40.320
I didn't have a will of my own.

12:41.150 --> 12:43.320
Even though I never bothered to understand anyone else,

12:44.320 --> 12:48.740
you tried to at least understand me for the way I was.

12:50.290 --> 12:54.290
But you still have a desire to pilot the Reaper.

12:56.000 --> 12:57.380
The Reaper?

12:58.170 --> 12:59.170
I do?

12:59.170 --> 13:02.300
Akashi-kun, you were
smiling a minute ago.

13:03.380 --> 13:08.430
But you're thinking
about someone else's smile.

13:08.430 --> 13:10.430
And you want to know the reason why.

13:11.890 --> 13:14.140
That's the hunch I got...

13:14.140 --> 13:17.690
But if I were to get on a Vess,

13:17.690 --> 13:21.440
would I be able to figure out what you want to know?

13:22.150 --> 13:23.030
Why...

13:23.650 --> 13:28.370
Akashi-kun, I want you to keep
smiling like you were earlier.

13:29.120 --> 13:30.280
This again.

13:30.990 --> 13:33.620
Why am I smiling?

13:34.580 --> 13:35.620
And at a time like this...

13:36.170 --> 13:38.630
Akashi-kun, you're crying.

13:40.840 --> 13:41.800
Crying?

13:43.260 --> 13:44.010
I am?

13:45.260 --> 13:46.180
Yeah.

13:53.680 --> 13:56.770
Maybe I just wanted you to understand me.

13:57.560 --> 14:03.360
After I first met you, maybe I
felt somewhere in my heart

14:04.610 --> 14:06.820
that you would understand me.

14:15.250 --> 14:18.080
Sasame is my warmth!

14:18.080 --> 14:19.790
I won't let you take it from me!

14:19.790 --> 14:23.300
If I can do more research on that Corpse,

14:23.300 --> 14:27.510
we could find a way to stop the progression of Necrometal

14:27.510 --> 14:29.340
before they turn into LIMs.

14:29.340 --> 14:33.810
No matter what I do,
I will make sure to defeat that Corpse!

14:34.310 --> 14:35.850
That's right.

14:35.850 --> 14:37.270
That wasn't just a dream.

14:39.020 --> 14:41.150
Hey!

14:41.150 --> 14:42.770
Where are you?

14:43.270 --> 14:45.320
Where?

14:45.320 --> 14:47.110
Where did they go?

14:50.740 --> 14:51.950
Akashi-kun...

14:56.870 --> 15:00.000
I was searching for Sasame back then.

15:00.000 --> 15:03.590
And ever since then, I had kept searching for her.

15:06.090 --> 15:09.010
So I'm not going to let go ever again.

15:10.970 --> 15:12.010
Really?

15:12.800 --> 15:14.180
Yeah.

15:14.180 --> 15:16.390
That's what I felt when I first met you.

15:18.020 --> 15:19.520
Is it really me?

15:23.730 --> 15:25.610
Oh, sorry...

15:26.400 --> 15:27.400
Sasame...

15:27.400 --> 15:28.530
I'll be going now.

15:30.700 --> 15:32.030
Actually...

15:32.610 --> 15:34.030
you should have a memory of it.

15:34.830 --> 15:35.740
Even you, Sasame.

15:36.740 --> 15:37.740
Minashi...

15:40.750 --> 15:44.250
We committed a sin.

15:50.050 --> 15:53.140
That's why we have to repent for it.

15:56.350 --> 16:00.350
That is the proof of our sin.

16:01.310 --> 16:03.980
Our sin...

16:06.110 --> 16:07.320
That's right.

16:07.770 --> 16:10.780
Hey! I brought her!

16:18.620 --> 16:19.120
Why...

16:20.080 --> 16:22.120
Back then, why did I...

16:22.960 --> 16:25.330
Why did I commit a sin?

16:26.630 --> 16:29.300
I'm scared of remembering everything about it...

16:30.210 --> 16:33.720
But one thing I'm certain of is that

16:34.220 --> 16:35.720
I took something away.

16:42.310 --> 16:43.520
Isn't it beautiful?

16:43.520 --> 16:44.310
Yeah.

16:49.110 --> 16:50.730
My atonement...

16:51.570 --> 16:53.900
What I should not forget...

16:55.530 --> 16:59.620
What Akashi-kun's been searching for...

17:01.200 --> 17:02.410
I'm sorry.

17:03.540 --> 17:05.580
It's thanks to you, Sasame.

17:07.130 --> 17:09.710
I didn't decide anything for myself.

17:10.340 --> 17:15.970
Entering the pilot course, piloting the Reaper, or going to the Lightless Realm.

17:16.640 --> 17:18.930
I was doing everything because that's how things turned out.

17:20.310 --> 17:24.270
But now I'm thinking I want
to clarify everything about me.

17:24.270 --> 17:28.440
Sorry. I'm sure you don't know what I'm talking about.

17:28.440 --> 17:31.110
No, that's not true.

17:31.110 --> 17:34.490
I can understand how you feel better than before.

17:34.490 --> 17:38.070
You might come to realize this sooner or later,

17:38.870 --> 17:42.120
so I have to properly...

17:45.790 --> 17:46.620
Sasame?

17:47.170 --> 17:49.540
No, it's nothing.

17:53.840 --> 17:55.090
Be careful.

17:56.300 --> 18:02.310
But even when I was with you back then,
the fact my heart felt warm was unchanging.

18:02.310 --> 18:03.810
TRAINING ROOM

18:03.810 --> 18:05.060
Sasame?

18:06.140 --> 18:07.270
Raika-san...

18:08.940 --> 18:13.940
I could only tell him to be careful.

18:15.820 --> 18:20.740
I was afraid of no longer being able to
stay at his side, so I couldn't say anything.

18:23.450 --> 18:25.160
No, that's not it...

18:25.750 --> 18:30.420
I was afraid of Akashi-kun finding out about the sin I committed.

18:38.510 --> 18:40.550
I'll stay right next to you.

18:43.510 --> 18:46.180
How much time's gone by already?

18:46.980 --> 18:48.810
What's happened to me?

18:55.860 --> 18:59.910
Looks like I haven't turned into Necrometal yet.

19:00.410 --> 19:01.660
Wait...

19:01.660 --> 19:03.780
Could this be an illusion?

19:03.780 --> 19:04.950
Or is it reality?

19:06.870 --> 19:08.750
I have to go.

19:08.750 --> 19:11.630
Sasame is waiting for me.

19:12.750 --> 19:15.420
Where is the Argent?

19:15.420 --> 19:16.420
Where's Aoshi?

19:18.010 --> 19:22.510
I'm not going to turn Sasame into something like that.

19:23.640 --> 19:28.680
I've always felt that I wanted to do something for everyone.

19:29.680 --> 19:33.190
However, I couldn't think of anything I could possibly do.

19:34.190 --> 19:38.280
When my body started to turn this way, I was scared at first.

19:39.530 --> 19:43.820
But thanks to that, I found
something I could do for everyone.

19:43.820 --> 19:46.280
That's no good.

19:46.910 --> 19:53.460
I had never felt the emotion of happiness until I came here.

19:54.500 --> 19:58.090
All of you gave me my happiness.

19:58.090 --> 20:03.090
So if I can save everyone from harm by becoming a LIM...

20:03.090 --> 20:04.470
Who do you mean by everyone?!

20:04.470 --> 20:05.720
No good.

20:05.720 --> 20:07.220
Absolutely no good!

20:15.440 --> 20:19.320
I can feel your memories, Akashi-kun.

20:20.440 --> 20:23.910
I'll make sure I defeat that Corpse.

20:25.370 --> 20:29.370
You were the one who taught me happiness.

20:30.290 --> 20:31.870
I want to protect it—

20:31.870 --> 20:35.630
my future with Sasame and our happiness.

20:35.630 --> 20:36.460
Akashi.

20:44.180 --> 20:45.640
Sasame?

20:46.800 --> 20:49.060
Follow me, Akashi.

20:50.180 --> 20:52.480
Wait for me, Sasame!

20:54.100 --> 20:55.440
Sasame!

21:17.670 --> 21:20.880
So this <i>is</i> reality?

21:41.150 --> 21:42.900
Dammit!

21:47.450 --> 21:54.500
Toss a coconut onto the black of Corpses...

21:50.370 --> 21:51.870
What's that sound?

21:56.460 --> 21:59.960
Is that Sasame's song? What's going on here?

22:22.020 --> 22:24.280
Wh-What's that?

22:26.070 --> 22:28.240
Is that a MA-Vess?

22:45.170 --> 22:55.810
Throwing away all my excuses, I traced over my abrased heart

22:55.810 --> 23:00.350
In the coldness of the locker room,

23:00.350 --> 23:06.820
Was an unfulfilled promise, locked away

23:07.320 --> 23:13.280
Dispel the darkness in this fallen world,

23:13.280 --> 23:17.830
And give me a reason why I should continue living

23:17.830 --> 23:23.210
The meaning of good-byes, the expectations of people,

23:23.210 --> 23:28.090
And the melodies that we played while never crossing paths

23:28.090 --> 23:33.800
I know I must not run away. The only path is straight ahead

23:33.800 --> 23:38.310
Even if this turns out to be a mistake

23:38.310 --> 23:43.900
The whirlpools of destiny will consume all loneliness

23:43.900 --> 23:51.990
It is an unerasable scar, an egoism that cannot be discarded

24:05.460 --> 24:10.470
Episode 13

24:05.460 --> 24:10.470
Roar of the Beast
